{"availability":"available","full":"masudbuilds/bazar-dor","name":"bazar-dor","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T11:14:42Z","updated":"2026-10-10T10:32:58Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://bazar-dor-phi.vercel.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://bazar-dor-phi.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.366Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.366Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.366Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.366Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modern real-time commodity price tracking and market analysis platform for daily essentials in Bangladesh.","বাজার দর (BazarDor) is a web application designed to bring transparency and accessibility to daily commodity and grocery prices in Bangladesh. By tracking price fluctuations across major wet markets and wholesale centers (such as Karwan Bazar, Mirpur-1, and Mohakhali), the platform empowers consumers and households to stay informed on real-time market rates, detect rising and falling price trends, and make informed purchasing decisions."],"features":["Live Price Marquee Ticker: A smooth, real-time scrolling marquee ticker displaying current prices of essential commodities across the top of the platform.","Daily Risers & Fallers (দর বৃদ্ধি ও হ্রাস): Automatically highlights the top 6 price risers (▲) and top 6 price fallers (▼) with clear delta badges and percentage changes.","Category Filtering & Dynamic Bengali Sorting: Effortlessly browse commodities by category with numerical price sorting options (কম থেকে বেশি, বেশি থেকে কম, সাধারণ).","Comprehensive Product Details & Market Comparison: Detailed product breakdown featuring minimum/maximum price summaries, unit indicators, and market-by-market comparison tables.","Secure Authentication & User Profile: Complete authentication powered by BetterAuth supporting Email/Password, Google OAuth, and GitHub OAuth, alongside profile update capabilities."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/masudbuilds/bazar-dor/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8e703bc78bf0e48b5a03629c393bc0e57b1e6f83fec6d3f235b5e0b87b232349","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.450Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.450Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A modern real-time commodity price tracking and market analysis platform for daily essentials in Bangladesh.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/masudbuilds/bazar-dor/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8e703bc78bf0e48b5a03629c393bc0e57b1e6f83fec6d3f235b5e0b87b232349","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/masudbuilds/bazar-dor/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.451Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T10:32:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/masudbuilds/bazar-dor/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.452Z","hash":"8e703bc78bf0e48b5a03629c393bc0e57b1e6f83fec6d3f235b5e0b87b232349","originalBytes":6264,"storedBytes":6264,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["price","client","category","github","market","next.js","product","project","secret","comparison","daily","dependencies","git","google","mongodb","page","route","api","auth","authentication","profile","real-time","top","across","amazingfeature","app","bazardor","better","betterauth","commodity","components","contact","dynamic","fallers","key","prices","protection","risers","routes","sorting","user","about","access","application","bangladesh.","bash","bazar-dor","bengali","better-auth","branch","cards","changes","clone","commit","commodities","consumers","contribute","contributions","css","daisyui","database","detailed","details","feature","features","folder","handlers","how","informed","install","installation","license","live","major","markets","marquee","npm","oauth","open","overview","platform","proxy.